  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { color: #f5f5f7; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>Isle 1.2.5</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Calendar: a &quot;more below&quot; chevron now appears on the events/reminders list when items are hidden under the fold, and disappears once you scroll to the bottom.</li>
      <li>Lyrics: Apple Music tracks now try their embedded lyrics first, with LRCLIB as a fallback; added diagnostics for missing lyrics.</li>
      <li>Settings: reorganized the sidebar — Messaging Apps moved to Productivity, Stats moved to System.</li>
      <li>New &quot;Contributors&quot; tab with a thank-you section and a donation option.</li>
    </ul>
</body>
</html>
